  C["CIRCULAR QUEUE: rear = (rear + 1) mod capacity<br/>the array becomes a ring and every freed slot becomes reachable again"]
  C --> S["THE RULE<br/>enqueue writes at (front + count) mod capacity, then count++<br/>dequeue reads front, then front = (front + 1) mod capacity, then count--"]
