  C --> N["THE COUNT FORMULA<br/>count = (rear - front + capacity) mod capacity<br/>state front 0 rear 3 gives 3, and the stored count is 3<br/>state front 2 rear 3 gives 1, and the stored count is 1<br/>state front 3 rear 2: a bare unsigned (rear - front) gives 18446744073709551615,<br/>while the formula gives 4 and the stored count is 4, and that is why the + capacity is there"]
  C --> A["FULL OR EMPTY, ONE COMPARISON CANNOT DECIDE BOTH<br/>front equals rear means empty, and it is also what capacity enqueues produce<br/>count based: front 3 rear 3 count 0 is empty, decided by the count<br/>sentinel slot: 4 of 5 slots usable, full is one comparison, and one slot is spent"]
